@baseUrl = http://localhost:80

### 1. 注册；重复执行应返回 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account": "demo_user",
  "password": "Password123",
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "mobile": "13800138000"
}

### 2. 登录；响应脚本把 Token 保存为 auth_token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account": "demo_user",
  "password": "Password123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.data.accessToken);
%}

### 3. 获取当前用户
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/me
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 4. 修改密码；响应脚本用新 Token 覆盖 auth_token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "Password123",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword456"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.data.accessToken);
%}

### 5. 使用新 Token 再次读取当前用户
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/me
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 6. 旧密码登录应返回 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account": "demo_user",
  "password": "Password123"
}
